        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Hunt Prey"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(concentrate)\n\nAjbal designates a single creature he can see and hear, or one he's Tracking, as his prey. Ajbal gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks to Seek his prey and Survival checks to Track his prey. The first time Ajbal hits his designated prey in a round, he deals an additional 2d8 precision damage.\n\nAjbal also ignores the penalty for making ranged attacks within the second range increment when attacking his prey. These effects last until Ajbal uses Hunt Prey again."
            },
